LunaAgent BETA __VERSION__
==========================

THIS IS A BETA BUILD (version 0.x.y). Expect rough edges until 1.0.0.

Which package?
--------------
  macOS 13 Ventura or newer  →  LunaAgent_13plus.pkg
  macOS 10.14–12             →  LunaAgent_Legacy_10.14.pkg

Check your version:
  sw_vers -productVersion

Install (prefer copy pkg to /tmp first if Desktop is TCC-blocked):
  cp LunaAgent_13plus.pkg /tmp/
  sudo installer -pkg /tmp/LunaAgent_13plus.pkg -target /

Verify sha256 against the .sha256 files in this folder.

Full documentation:
  https://github.com/mxxnly/Luna-Agent/blob/main/docs/install.md

See README-13plus.txt or README-Legacy.txt for channel-specific notes.
